{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56817","headline":"四真人降魏夫人歌共五章（幷序） 方诸青童歌一章 · 项宗","name":"四真人降魏夫人歌共五章（幷序） 方诸青童歌一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太霞扇晨晖，九气无常形。\n玄辔飞霄外，八景乘高清。\n手把玉皇袂，携我晨中生。\n盼观七曜房，朗朗亦冥冥。\n超哉魏氏子，有心复有情。\n玄挺自嘉会，金书东华名。\n贤安密所研，相期阳谷汧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}